/A 1835 0 R
/Alt (Four versions of the same 2023 true-color Sentinel-2 image showing a clearcut \(white to light pink\) surrounded by forested mountains. Original \(a\) shows dark north-facing and light south-facing slopes. ESA correction \(b\) adds severe salt-and-pepper noise on north slopes. TSDP with NASADEM \(c\) removes shading but introduces small rolling hills not visible in the original image. TSDP with Copernicus DEM \(d\) is flatter, but both \(c\) and \(d\) alter colors: north slopes look greyish, south slopes look oversaturated green.)
